<title>AUSTRIA: BWT 1996 EPS climbs to 106 ATS.</title>
<headline>BWT 1996 EPS climbs to 106 ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Water treatment technology maker BWT's 1996 earnings per share rose to 106 schillings per share after 103 a year ago, the Association of Austrian analysts said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>BWT on Tuesday released a record set of group earnings for 1996. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
